    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But what about the arguments that say the Second Amendment shouldn't be interpreted as an absolute right to any weapon? Even with Bruen, some legal scholars argue that the 'historical tradition' test still allows for some regulation. You seem pretty certain it's basically unconstitutional, though. Why is that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
